	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles came at Rance’s'
	R
	'summons, and was respectfully'
	R
	'kneeling to him.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0251e:
	ZH 1:
	'So?'
	R
	'Gotten used to the Leazas Army'
