	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0251e:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s wrong?'
	R
	'Don’t space out in front of'
	R
	'the King.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... My apologies.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh...'
	R
	'I can never get Empress Sheila'
	R
	'completely off my mind.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0251e:
	ZH 1:
	'Sheila?'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
