	'I had no idea about how'
	R
	'cruelly Stessel treated her.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0251e:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... So that’s what’s'
	R
	'bothering you?'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
	'...I want to go after him'
	R
	'right now and torture him'
	R
	'until he begs for death...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance, I’ll fight to meet'
	R
	'your expectations... So...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'If I’m still alive after I take'
	R
	'out Stessel, please place me at'
	R
	'the lowest level of the army,'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'at least...'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_025c6:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles’s eyes were'
	R
	'unimaginably fierce next to his'
	R
	'calm, handsome face...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'They were full of bloodlust.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0253a:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmm, interesting guy.'
