	'for Pamela...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'And certainly not for Stessel.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Empress Sheila. For you alone,'
	R
	'I’d even listen to the orders of'
	R
	'the man who killed my friend...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'And give my life.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... So I will stay here'
