	' Planned City Laurengrad'
	R
	'　　　　2nd Army HQ'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles was sitting at a'
	R
	'large desk in the command room,'
	R
	'reading a report from a spy.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0253a:
	ZH 1:
	'...I see...'
	R
	'It seems my judgment wasn’t'
	R
	'wrong.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Everything is tied to'
	R
	'Stessel...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'...Unbelievable...'
	R
	'This man is a sly one...'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
	'’Scuse me, General Aristoles.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	!VAR0516 : 433!
	\L_025e2:
	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve gathered this month’s'
	R
	'reports.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh?'
	R
	'What’s that?'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0251e:
	ZH 1:
	'A report from my spy.'
	R
	'It states Stessel’s cunning'
	R
	'activities.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
	'Uh...'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0251e:
	ZH 1:
	'I don’t want to believe that'
	R
	'Dowager Empress Pamela was an'
	R
	'accomplice...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'She’s Empress Sheila’s mother...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Well...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'I was able to get evidence that'
	R
	'should put the blame for the'
	R
	'crimes all on Stessel...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Because she’s Empress Sheila’s'
	R
	'mother, I want to help her.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Just watch...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ll show this to everyone,'
	R
	'he’ll be exposed,'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'and I’ll get the council members'
	R
	'found guilty too.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_025aa:
	ZH 1:
	'Gegeh...!'
	R
	'This guy’s gotten a hold of'
	R
	'that much info?'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0251e:
	ZH 1:
	'Prepare the carriage.'
	R
	'I’m going to Lang Bau to wring'
	R
	'the life out of Stessel.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_025aa:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh shit, oh shit...'
	R
	'Oh shiiit～～!'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh yeah!'
	R
	'This is the perfect time'
	R
	'for...!'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, hey!!'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0251e:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	R
	'Stop yelling.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
	\L_0258e:
	ZH 1:
	'I just remembered something'
	R
	'regarding Empress Sheila.'
	R
	'Take these, General Aristoles.'
	\L_02643:
	\L_02636:
