*L_01547:
	ZH 1:
	'Convert「Whaddaya think?'
	R
	'        Nice photos, right?」'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles「But... How did you get these...?'
	R
	'          Pictures of Empress Sheila in private...」'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Convert「A subordinate said he took ’em for you.」'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles「...........」'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Convert「General Aristoles?」'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles「Empress Sheila...」'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles went to his own world for a bit.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Convert「Oh, that’s right.'
	R
	'        I got another letter from Empress Sheila.」'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles「Give it to me!!」'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'Aristoles snatched the letter from Convert.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'  My beloved Aristoles.'
	R
	'  I’ve heard about your efforts from all the way in'
	R
	'  Lang Bau.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'  When you try hard, it encourages me to try hard'
	R
	'  too...'
	R
	'  So...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'  Please do your best.'
	R
	'  Then when this war is over, let’s have a meal'
	R
	'  together.'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'  I look forward to hearing stories of your heroism'
	R
	'  directly...'
	\L_02643:
	ZH 1:
	'  Until next time...'
	R
	'     Sheila'
